<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ss">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Mayelana | Alfa Online Radio</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

  <!-- SEO -->
  <meta name="description" content="Lwati lwesiSwati ku-Alfa Online Radio – imininingwane, injongo, nekuchumana.">
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0f172a">

  <!-- Open Graph (Cloudflare-safe absolute paths) -->
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Mayelana | Alfa Online Radio">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Lwati lwesiSwati nge-Alfa Online Radio.">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://siswati.alfaradio.co.za/info.html">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://alfaradio.co.za/og-image.png">

  <!-- Favicon (absolute paths) -->
  <link rel="icon" href="https://alfaradio.co.za/favicon.ico">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="https://alfaradio.co.za/favicon-32.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="https://alfaradio.co.za/favicon-16.png">

  <style>
    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      background: #0f172a;
      color: #f8fafc;
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    header img {
      display: block;
      max-width: 140px;
      height: auto;
      margin: 0 auto 0.5rem;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0.2rem 0 0;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    }

    section {
      margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
    }

    section h2 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      color: #38bdf8;
    }

    section p {
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .actions {
      margin-top: 3rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.3rem;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-align: center;
      min-width: 240px;
    }

    .btn-home {
      background: #22c55e;
      color: #052e16;
    }

    .btn-home:hover {
      background: #16a34a;
    }

    .btn-whatsapp {
      background: #25d366;
      color: #052e16;
    }

    .btn-whatsapp:hover {
      background: #1ebe5b;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      opacity: 0.75;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }
  </style>

  <!-- Cloudflare Web Analytics -->
  <script defer src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js"
          data-cf-beacon='{"token": "0505b11108564b33b0d5d66509727745"}'>
  </script>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- Shared header injection -->
  <div id="site-header"></div>

  <main>
    <section>
      <h2>Ngubani futsi yini i-Alfa Online Radio?</h2>
      <p>
        IRadio Alfa yacala kusakata Tindzaba Letimnandzi ku-FM ngenyanga yaMeyi ngemnyaka wa-2000.
        I-Alfa Online Radio yacala kusakateka nge-inthanethi ngenyanga yaSepthemba ngemnyaka wa-2023
        ngesiSwati nangesiZulu. Balaleli bangalalela tinhlelo nemisebenti ye-Alfa Online Radio
        ngemakhalekhukhwini abo kanye nangemakhompyutha.
      </p>
      <p>
        I-Alfa Online Radio isakata kufundvwa kweBhayibheli ngevesi nangevesi, kufundziswa
        kweBhayibheli, kanye nemicondvo nekukhutsata lokwakha umoya.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Kungani libito lelitsi “Alfa”?</h2>
      <p>
        Libito lelitsi <strong>“Alfa”</strong> libonakalisa kutsi Nkulunkulu usicalo nesiphetfo,
        ungumtfombo wekuphila, weliciniso, futsi unguLowo lowenta konkhe kube kusha.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Imininingwane yekutsintana</h2>
      <p>
        • Joyina iWhatsApp Community Group kute utfole timemetelo netindzaba tetinhlelo.
      </p>
      <p>
        • Sithinte ku <strong>info@alfaradio.co.za</strong>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="actions">
      <!-- WhatsApp button -->
      <a
        href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/LFdZxr0VG6S6omDG2KlukL"
        class="btn btn-whatsapp"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
      >
        👥💬 Hlanganyela licembu leWhatsApp
      </a>

      <!-- Home button -->
      <a href="https://siswati.alfaradio.co.za" class="btn btn-home">
        🏠 Buyela Ekhaya
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    © <span id="year"></span> Alfa Online Radio
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Shared header loader (Cloudflare / GitHub safe)
    fetch("/shared/header.html")
      .then(r => r.text())
      .then(html => {
        document.getElementById("site-header").innerHTML = html;
      });

    document.getElementById("year").textContent =
      new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>

</body>
</html>
